  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Icod.Terminal 1.2.0 adds typed, bounded urxvt-style OSC 777 titled desktop notifications while preserving the stable 1.x contract and the existing OSC 9 notification API. TerminalSession.SendTitledNotificationAsync emits canonical OSC 777;notify;title;message ST framing using strict UTF-8, complete-frame prevalidation, a 4096-byte payload bound, shared session output serialization, and pre-commit cancellation. Semicolons and C0/C1/DEL controls are rejected because OSC 777 defines no interoperable field-escaping grammar. The release retains net8.0/net9.0/net10.0, existing dependencies, OSC 633 behavior, and all prior 1.x semantics. Full notes: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.2.0/docs/releases/1.2.0.md ; compatibility: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.2.0/docs/Compatibility-and-Versioning.md",
